      ],
      "text": "The daemon exposes a dashboard config editor at /dashboard/config and a PATCH /api/v1/config endpoint; every patch must submit the revision of the file generation that produced the published values, and when token auth is unset the endpoint accepts only loopback peer/Host requests and rejects proxy-forwarding headers."
    },
