      ],
      "text": "Model suggestions are served via GET /api/v1/agent/models?vendor=..., combining a built-in per-vendor static list with an optional best-effort probe of the local vendor CLI; the catalog is advisory only, not an allowlist, and arbitrary model IDs remain valid."
