        "slc_f75746b1b5be40405fda9b54ff54eacc05ea11524e1b1cb83dce28114056a774"
      ],
      "text": "looperd loads configuration in layers: built-in defaults, config file, environment variables, then CLI flags; later layers override earlier ones, objects merge deeply, arrays are replaced as a whole, and omitted fields keep the previous layer's value."
    },
