        "slc_d31ab055a21de4b43b5574cab516455efb05ea00e04ab550b58ac71a442004c8"
      ],
      "text": "In routed mode, loopernet centralizes webhook ingress and Node wakeups but must not mutate GitHub on its own; the Coordinator writes coarse GitHub authority first and the exact target label last, with polling retained as fallback and drift recovery."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_1e441d515b435f94340b7859f8a56ff8fbcb537bfc7ac9c8434bec7c56c4449c",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "tools-permissions",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "141510c0967f1b9888a07cbbe8ccadb07ff879f8",
          "git_sha": "66efe7e0bfc9fad3b0545015167371689a745de7",
          "line_end": 369,
          "line_start": 369,
          "path": "docs/configuration.md",
          "repository": "nexu-io/looper",
          "url": "https://github.com/nexu-io/looper/blob/141510c0967f1b9888a07cbbe8ccadb07ff879f8/docs/configuration.md#L369-L369"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_1bc4250db3538c33a6d7f4eaff0bc344f754a65e29b0f7498369951b38a60320"
      ],
      "text": "For fresh unattended Grok Build runs, Looper supplies --always-approve and --sandbox off by default; configured agent arguments override these, so operators may choose a stricter --sandbox, and non-plain output formats can break result-marker parsing."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_743410e6ed68dd8f74cc248988a8f74bb66e6881ceb1d81a53341d4c7d6a78b1",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "tools-permissions",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "141510c0967f1b9888a07cbbe8ccadb07ff879f8",
          "git_sha": "66efe7e0bfc9fad3b0545015167371689a745de7",
          "line_end": 562,
          "line_start": 558,
          "path": "docs/configuration.md",
          "repository": "nexu-io/looper",
          "url": "https://github.com/nexu-io/looper/blob/141510c0967f1b9888a07cbbe8ccadb07ff879f8/docs/configuration.md#L558-L562"
        },
        {
          "commit": "141510c0967f1b9888a07cbbe8ccadb07ff879f8",
          "git_sha": "66efe7e0bfc9fad3b0545015167371689a745de7",
          "line_end": 540,
          "line_start": 528,
          "path": "docs/configuration.md",
          "repository": "nexu-io/looper",
          "url": "https://github.com/nexu-io/looper/blob/141510c0967f1b9888a07cbbe8ccadb07ff879f8/docs/configuration.md#L528-L540"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_9fee22dcd3cae0aa71a1b6c540efc9f6234d7b0ec8a5b8a109d4c7c20023fe22",
        "slc_d58aab7ab542ad17405b5b4a0811409abc798179c94133df12690ca224a2cac1"
      ],
      "text": "Hosting tokens, private-key references, and personal GitHub/SSH authentication are stripped from agent environments after overrides merge; credential-bearing Git/GitHub CLI commands have a four-minute ceiling, and this is a credential/command-routing boundary rather than an OS sandbox."
    },
