      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_7a55857017067a570e337d29116ad9b8a6cee8ddb28a8cd17b21306e6569b678",
        "slc_aceba412f71a3eac37500f9ba5eb5683b34d37bddd144fac45bc5c257b18b8f9",
        "slc_c37ed17bddd73ac854af6f5270bdfb12aeffaca957513cf7773d3aeff63f0f98"
      ],
      "text": "In-flight runs keep the immutable config snapshot and durable per-run agent snapshot they started with; resume/retry lineages copy the predecessor's agent_snapshot_json rather than re-resolving live config, and Looper never sends an old vendor's native session ID to a different CLI."
    },
