        "slc_50f171928fa6a4391c79c52a6f9b47e9f204f5a7ac1329718af0a4a11ac6dd05"
      ],
      "text": "Repository development practice: a separate sandbox-e2e CI workflow runs on main and manual dispatch using a repository variable and secret for a GitHub App, mints an installation token via actions/create-github-app-token, and cleans up temporary issues, PRs, and branches afterward."
    }
